-- title:
--   Linear disjointness ascends a finite extension under a degree bound
-- statement:
--   Let $k$ be a field, let $E \subseteq E'$ be fields with $k$-algebra structures and $E'$ an $E$-algebra forming a scalar tower over $k$, with $E'$ finite as an $E$-module; let $C$ and $\Omega$ be fields with $C$ a $k$-algebra, $\Omega$ a $C$-algebra and a $k$-algebra, the three forming a scalar tower. Let $\iota \colon E \to \Omega$ and $\iota' \colon E' \to \Omega$ be ring homomorphisms such that $\iota$ agrees on $k$ with the composite $k \to C \to \Omega$, i.e. $\iota(z \cdot 1) = z \cdot 1$ for $z \in k$ in the respective structure maps, and such that $\iota'$ restricted along $E \to E'$ equals $\iota$. Assume: (h1) for every finite subset $t \subseteq E$ whose elements are $k$-linearly independent in $E$, their images under $\iota$ are $C$-linearly independent in $\Omega$; and (h2) $[E' : E] = \operatorname{finrank}_E E'$ is at most $\operatorname{relfinrank}$ of the subfield of $\Omega$ generated by $\operatorname{im}(C \to \Omega) \cup \operatorname{im} \iota$ inside the subfield generated by $\operatorname{im}(C \to \Omega) \cup \operatorname{im} \iota'$, that is, the degree of the latter over its intersection with the former. The conclusion: for every finite subset $t \subseteq E'$ whose elements are $k$-linearly independent in $E'$, their images under $\iota'$ are $C$-linearly independent in $\Omega$.
--
--   This is the statement that linear disjointness of $E$ and $C$ over $k$ inside $\Omega$ propagates to the finite extension $E'$ of $E$, the degree inequality $[E':E] \le [C\,\iota'(E') : C\,\iota(E)]$ supplying the missing independence; the linear independence formulation is the finitary form of injectivity of $E' \otimes_k C \to \Omega$. It is used in the Čerednik–Drinfel'd descent arguments [`CerednikDrinfeld.descentIntertwining_of_base_one_zero`](thm.html#CerednikDrinfeld.descentIntertwining_of_base_one_zero) and [`CerednikDrinfeld.descentIntertwining_of_base_zero_one`](thm.html#CerednikDrinfeld.descentIntertwining_of_base_zero_one).
